// The library stress song, a synthetic worst case for the engine: one track of every
// instrument playing its preview in a loop, chords on the chord instruments and the full
// insert chain on four tracks. pnpm sim --scale renders it against the 6% budget. A new
// instrument adds its line here (library.test.ts checks every one is present).
tempo 124
key c minor

acid:       acid c2 c2 c3 c2! eb2 c2 bb1 c2 | gain 0.3 | lowpass 2000 | highpass 200 | distort 0.3 | crush 0.3 | chorus 0.3 | phaser 0.3 | eq-high 2 | comp 0.4 | gate 0.3
bass:       bass . c2 . c2 . c2 . eb2 / . ab1 . ab1 . bb1 . g1 | gain 0.3
bell:       bell c4 ~ ~ ~ g4 ~ eb4 ~ / ab4 ~ ~ ~ g4 ~ ~ ~ | gain 0.3
bongo:      bongo x.x. .x.x x.xx .x.x | gain 0.3
boom:       boom c1 ~ ~ . . . c1 . / . . eb1 ~ ~ ~ . . | gain 0.3
brass:      brass Cm ~ . Cm Bb ~ ~ ~ / Ab ~ ~ ~ Bb ~ ~ ~ | gain 0.3
choir:      choir Cm ~ ~ ~ / Ab ~ Bb ~ | gain 0.3
clap:       clap .... x... .... x... | gain 0.3
conga:      conga ..x. x..x ..x. x.xx | gain 0.3
cowbell:    cowbell x.x. ..x. x.x. ..x. | gain 0.3
crash:      crash x... .... .... .... | gain 0.3
djembe:     djembe x..x ..x. x.x. .xx. | gain 0.3
downlifter: downlifter x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ | gain 0.3
epiano:     epiano . Cm7 . . Cm7 . . . / . Abmaj7 . . Abmaj7 . . . | gain 0.3 | lowpass 2000 | highpass 200 | distort 0.3 | crush 0.3 | chorus 0.3 | phaser 0.3 | eq-high 2 | comp 0.4 | gate 0.3
fm-bass:    fm-bass c2 . c2 . eb2 . c2 g1 | gain 0.3
fm-lead:    fm-lead c4 ~ eb4 . g4 ~ ~ . / bb4 ~ g4 . eb4 ~ ~ . | gain 0.3
harp:       harp c3 g3 eb4 g4 c5 g4 eb4 g3 / ab2 eb3 c4 eb4 ab4 eb4 c4 eb3 | gain 0.3
hat:        hat .x.x .x.x .x.x .x.x | gain 0.3
impact:     impact x... .... .... .... | gain 0.3
kalimba:    kalimba c4 . eb4 g4 . bb4 . g4 / eb4 . c5 . g4 . eb4 . | gain 0.3
kick:       kick x... x... x... x... | gain 0.3
lead:       lead c4 ~ eb4 . g4 ~ bb4 ~ / g4 ~ ~ ~ eb4 ~ ~ . | gain 0.3 | lowpass 2000 | highpass 200 | distort 0.3 | crush 0.3 | chorus 0.3 | phaser 0.3 | eq-high 2 | comp 0.4 | gate 0.3
mallet:     mallet c4 . eb4 . g4 . bb4 g4 / ab3 . c4 . eb4 . c4 . | gain 0.3
noise:      noise x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ | gain 0.3
organ:      organ Cm ~ ~ ~ / Ab ~ Bb ~ | gain 0.3
pad:        pad Cm7 ~ ~ ~ / Abmaj7 ~ ~ ~ | gain 0.3 | lowpass 2000 | highpass 200 | distort 0.3 | crush 0.3 | chorus 0.3 | phaser 0.3 | eq-high 2 | comp 0.4 | gate 0.3
perc:       perc ..x. .x.. ...x .x.. | gain 0.3
piano:      piano c3+eb3+g3 ~ ~ . bb3 . g3 . / Abmaj7 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . . | gain 0.3
pluck:      pluck c3 eb3 g3 c4 g3 eb3 c3 g2 / ab2 c3 eb3 ab3 eb3 c3 bb2 g2 | gain 0.3
reese:      reese c2 ~ ~ ~ eb2 ~ g1 ~ | gain 0.3
ride:       ride x.xx x.x. x.xx x.x. | gain 0.3
rim:        rim ..x. ...x ..x. .x.. | gain 0.3
riser:      riser x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ | gain 0.3
shaker:     shaker x.xx x.xX x.xx x.xX | gain 0.3
snare:      snare .... x... .... x..x | gain 0.3
square:     square c4 . g4 . eb4 . g4 . / bb3 . g4 . eb4 . c4 . | gain 0.3
stab:       stab . Cm7 . . . Cm7 . . / . Abmaj7 . . . Bb . . | gain 0.3
strings:    strings Cm ~ ~ ~ / Ab ~ Bb ~ | gain 0.3
sub:        sub c1 ~ . c1 . . eb1 ~ / g0 ~ . g0 . . bb0 . | gain 0.3
supersaw:   supersaw Cm ~ ~ ~ / Ab ~ Bb ~ | gain 0.3
sweep:      sweep x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ | gain 0.3
tom:        tom x.x. x... .x.x x... | gain 0.3
vox:        vox c4 ~ eb4 ~ g4 ~ ~ . / f4 ~ eb4 ~ c4 ~ ~ . | gain 0.3
woodblock:  woodblock ..x. ..x. .x.x x... | gain 0.3
